ng): void&lt;br&gt;+ getEvade(): Optional&amp;lt;Evade&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;- startEvade(Evade): void&lt;br&gt;- evadeStep(Evade): void&lt;br&gt;- countDownEvadeCooldowns(): void&lt;br&gt;- walkAndAttack(): void&lt;br&gt;+ getPickUpTarget(): Optional&amp;lt;ItemDrop&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;- take(ItemDrop): void&lt;br&gt;- centre(): Vector2&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;- distanceTo(ItemDrop, Vector2): float&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;+ getInteractTarget(): Optional&amp;lt;Interactable&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;- distanceToBox(Aabb, Vector2): float&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;- walk(): void&lt;br&gt;- step(Vector2): void&lt;br&gt;- reachablePart(Vector2, Vector2): float&lt;br&gt;- attackTowards(Vector2): void&lt;br&gt;- canStandAt(Vector2): boolean&lt;br&gt;+ isMoving(): boolean&lt;br&gt;+ writeState(StateBuffer): void&lt;br&gt;+ readState(StateBuffer): void&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="76" y="1429" width="577" height="716" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;div style='line-height:15px'&gt;&lt;div style='text-align:center'&gt;«abstract»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Enemy&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='border-top:1px solid #333333;margin:3px -6px'&gt;&lt;/div&gt;- ai: StateMachine&amp;lt;Enemy, EnemyState&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;- target: Optional&amp;lt;Character&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;- summoned: boolean&lt;br&gt;- spriteId: String&lt;br&gt;- rushing: boolean&lt;div style='border-top:1px solid #333333;margin:3px -6px'&gt;&lt;/div&gt;# Enemy(EnemySetup, Attack)&lt;br&gt;+ getFaction(): Faction&lt;br&gt;+ getTarget(): Optional&amp;lt;Character&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;+ getState(): EnemyState&lt;br&gt;# think(long): void&lt;br&gt;+ canSee(Character): boolean&lt;br&gt;+ alert(Character): void&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;# attackTarget(World): void&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;# canReach(Character): boolean&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br